get_latest_magnetogram.py (MPetrenk)
====================================
version: Oct 21  2025
Copies files in SUBMISSION_DATA to run_realtime/SC/tmp
Copies the latest magnetogram from ISWA to run_realtime/SC/tmp
Unzip the latest magnetogram fitsfile.
Make a tarball from run_realtime/SC/tmp to run_realtime/SC/submission.tgz

get_magnetogram_cron.py
=======================
version Nov 21 2025
Check out the latest magnetogram in the ISWA database
Copies the unzipped magnetogram as fitsfile.fits to SUBMISSION_DATA

get_magnetogram_pleiades.py
===========================
verion Nov 22 2025
Make a tarball from SUBMISSION_DATA directory to run_realtime/SC/submission.tgz

clone_iswa_gong.py
===========================
Version Jan 3 2026
Clone a sequence of magnetograms from ISWA database in the time/date range
(min and max date/time values are input parameters) to ISWACLONE directory

get_clone_magnetogram.py
===========================
Version Jan 3 2026
For time stamp stored in SUBMISSION_DATA/datetime.txt pull a magnetogram
fitsfile from ISWACLONE and advance datetime.txt time stamp by 1 hour.

